<title>USA: TABLE- Amoco Corp sells $300 mln debentures.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Amoco Corp sells $300 mln debentures.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Amoco Corp was priced on Tuesday, according to lead manager Morgan Stanley, Dean Witter &amp; Discover Co.</p>
<p>Amoco Corp is a major integrated oil company.</p>
<p>BORROWER AMOCO CORP</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 6.50 PCT   MATURITY 8/1/2007</p>
<p>TYPE DEBENTURES    ISS PRICE 99.584  FIRST PAY DATE 2/1/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S AA1   YIELD 6.557 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P AAA	 SPREAD +32 BPS    CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>((Caryn Trokie, U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1678))</p>
